    "summary": "Errata to Emperor's Children datasheets. Unit characteristics change as follows:\n\n- Chaos Terminators, Lord Kakophanist and Lucius the Eternal: T6\n- Infractors, Lord Exultant, Sorcerer and Tormentors: T5\n- Noise Marines: W3\n\nWeapon profiles change as follows:\n\n- Bolt Pistol of Flawless Blades, Infractors, Lord Exultant, Sorcerer and Tormentors: S5 and AP-1\n- Boltgun of Tormentors: S5 and AP-1\n- Combi-bolter and Combi-weapon of Chaos Land Raider, Chaos Rhino and Chaos Terminators: S5 and AP-1\n- Close Combat Weapon of Lord Exultant, Lord Kakophanist, Noise Marines and Tormentors: S5 only\n- Duelling Sabre of Infractors: S5 only",
